CDCl3) δ ; 157.97, 135.13, 133.79, 132.38, 131.27, 129.65, 128.30,
127.69, 127.26, 126.13, 126.1, 119.24, 105.61, 55.37; HRMS (FI) calcd for
C18H13F3O [M]+ 302.0918, found 302.0905 (Δ = 1.3 mDa, 4.3 ppm).
