$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM "Nok": A Phytosterol-Based Amphiphile Enabling Transition-Metal-Catalyzed
Couplings in Water at Room Temperature
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Klumphu, Piyatida; Lipshutz, Bruce H.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2014), 79(3), 888-900

